== Trivia ==
*{{Item|Cooked Mutton}} was originally obtained using a Bazaar in a glitched lobby that allowed you to drop items from the Bazaar GUI. When {{Item|Enchanted Cooked Mutton}} was dropped, the game automatically converted it into its glitched unenchanted form.
*Food items are mentioned in [[Cult_of_the_Fallen_Star#Dialogue| Cult of the Fallen Star]] meeting #5 when {{NPCSprite|Brarnas}} states "Thondin made the realization that food actually has no taste or texture, though we are inclined to eat it". This statement is used by the cult members as evidence that the NPC's are living in a simulation.

